    "created_at": "2026-04-20 16:25:16 -04:00",
    "full_text": "> We cannot change that.\n\nPrecisely why I say we should be researching a native LST and shouldn't move forward with an issuance change unless we have that\n\n> But we can ensure that solo staking remains possible for those who care about supporting and protecting the protocol\n\nAnd how's that? If there's negative yield then all stakers will take a hit so you can assume equilibrium at 0 yield. At that point there's no difference between the 2 situations. And in both situations (0 yield) you're assuming they're willing to stake regardless.",
